# 3D Game Generalist Portfolio Website

A responsive static portfolio site built around your existing resume positioning.

## Files
- `index.html` — website content
- `styles.css` — visual design
- `script.js` — mobile navigation + reveal animation
- `assets/` — put project screenshots here

## Fastest way to preview
Double-click `index.html`.

## Before publishing
Search and replace:
- `YOUR NAME`
- `YOUR_EMAIL@example.com`
- Upwork placeholder link
- LinkedIn / other placeholder link

## Replace project placeholders with screenshots
A simple approach:

1. Put a screenshot in `assets/`, e.g.:
   `assets/my-tiny-tower.jpg`

2. In the corresponding `.project-visual` element, add:
   `style="background-image:url('assets/my-tiny-tower.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center;"`

3. Delete or keep the `.visual-placeholder` text depending on your preference.

For the strongest portfolio presentation, use:
- 16:9 gameplay screenshots
- clean Unity scene captures
- UI / before-after visual examples
- optimization screenshots only when they clearly support a case study

## Free deployment options
- GitHub Pages
- Vercel
- Netlify

This is a static site and needs no backend.

